  "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex,nofollow\">\n  <title>Team — LouisianaTech</title>\n  <style>\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\n    body{margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,Oxygen,Ubuntu,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;background:#f7f9fb;line-height:1.6}\n    header{background:#1B5E8C;color:#fff;padding:18px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n    header .brand{font-weight:700;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:.3px}\n    header .brand span{opacity:.7;margin-left:8px;font-weight:400;font-size:14px}\n    header nav a{color:#fff;text-decoration:none;margin-left:24px;font-size:14px;opacity:.85}\n    header nav a:hover{opacity:1}\n    main{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:64px 32px}\n    h1{font-size:36px;margin:0 0 8px;letter-spacing:-.5px}\n    .lede{color:#475560;font-size:17px;margin:0 0 56px;max-width:680px}\n    .group{margin-bottom:48px}\n    .group h2{color:#1B5E8C;font-size:14px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin:0 0 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5ecf2;padding-bottom:10px}\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:24px}\n    .person{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5ecf2;border-radius:8px;padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}\n    .avatar{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#1B5E8C;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:18px;margin-bottom:14px;letter-spacing:.5px}\n    .name{font-weight:700;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:2px}\n    .role{color:#475560;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:10px}\n    .bio{font-size:13px;color:#7a8896;flex-grow:1}\n    .meta{margin-top:12px;font-size:12px;color:#94a3b0}\n    footer{text-align:center;padding:32px 16px;color:#7a8896;font-size:13px;border-top:1px solid #e5ecf2;background:#fff;margin-top:48px}\n    footer a{color:#1B5E8C;text-decoration:none}\n    .stats{display:flex;gap:32px;margin:24px 0 56px;padding:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5ecf2;border-radius:8px}\n    .stat{flex:1;text-align:center}\n    .stat .n{font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:#1B5E8C}\n    .stat .l{font-size:13px;color:#7a8896;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px}\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header>\n    <div class=\"brand\"><a href=\"/\" style=\"color:#fff;text-decoration:none\">LouisianaTech</a> <span>⚜ dev</span></div>\n    <nav>\n      <a href=\"/services\">Services</a>\n      <a href=\"/team\">Team</a>\n      <a href=\"/contact\">Contact</a>\n      <a href=\"/dashboard\">Sign in</a>\n    </nav>\n  </header>\n  <main>\n    <h1>Twelve people. Baton Rouge.</h1>\n    <p class=\"lede\">We're small on purpose. Every engagement has a senior engineer or designer as the day-one owner — not a junior with a Slack channel of people who never showed up.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"stats\">\n      <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"n\">12</div><div class=\"l\">Total team</div></div>\n      <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"n\">9</div><div class=\"l\">Years shipping</div></div>\n      <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"n\">47</div><div class=\"l\">Projects delivered</div></div>\n      <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"n\">100%</div><div class=\"l\">In Baton Rouge HQ</div></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <section class=\"group\">\n      <h2>Leadership</h2>\n      <div class=\"grid\">\n        <div class=\"person\"><div class=\"avatar\">SB</div><div class=\"name\">Sarah Boudreaux</div><div class=\"role\">Founder &amp; CEO</div><div class=\"bio\">LSU CS '11. Spent four years at Schlumberger's New Iberia office before starting LouisianaTech in 2017. Runs sales, hates time sheets.</div><div class=\"meta\">sarah@louisianatech.io</div></div>\n        <div class=\"person\"><div class=\"avatar\">JW</div><div class=\"name\">Jamal Williams</div><div class=\"role\">CTO</div><div class=\"bio\">Joined as employee #3 in 2018. Previously at Lookout in San Francisco. Owns architecture, security, and the on-call rotation.</div><div class=\"meta\">jamal@louisianatech.io</div></div>\n        <div class=\"person\"><div class=\"avatar\">ML</div><div class=\"name\">Marie LeBlanc</div><div class=\"role\">Head of Design</div><div class=\"bio\">RISD '14. Eight years freelance before joining in 2021. Runs the design practice and the brand. Insists every product ships with a real type system.</div><div class=\"meta\">marie@louisianatech.io</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"group\">\n      <h2>Engineering</h2>\n      <div class=\"grid\">\n        <div class=\"person\"><div class=\"avatar\">DT</div><div class=\"name\">David Tran</div><div class=\"role\">Senior Engineer · Backend</div><div class=\"bio\">Postgres whisperer. Built our SCADA bridge platform from scratch. Previously at iSeatz.</div></div>\n        <div class=\"person\"><div class=\"avatar\">HR</div><div class=\"name\">Hector Reyes</div><div class=\"role\">Senior Engineer · Frontend</div><div class=\"bio\">Next.js since v2. Cares too much about Core Web Vitals. Co-owns the design system with Marie.</div></div>\n        <div class=\"person\"><div class=\"avatar\">AP</div><div class=\"name\">Aisha Patel</div><div class=\"role\">Senior Engineer · Mobile</div><div class=\"bio\">React Native + Swift. Built the field-ticket app every oil &amp; gas client lives in.</div></div>\n        <div class=\"person\"><div class=\"avatar\">BF</div><div class=\"name\">Ben Falgout</div><div class=\"role\">Engineer · Platform</div><div class=\"bio\">AWS, Terraform, Datadog. Runs our infra and the deploy pipeline. Holds the AWS SAP cert.</div></div>\n        <div class=\"person\"><div class=\"avatar\">LN</div><div class=\"name\">Lena Nguyen</div><div class=\"role\">Engineer · Data</div><div class=\"bio\">dbt, Snowflake, and the dashboards your CFO actually opens. Came from Capital One.</div></div>\n        <div class=\"person\"><div class=\"avatar\">CM</div><div class=\"name\">Connor McGraw</div><div class=\"role\">Engineer · Product</div><div class=\"bio\">LSU '23, joined as our first full-time hire out of school. Now owns three production services.</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"group\">\n      <h2>Design &amp; Operations</h2>\n      <div class=\"grid\">\n        <div class=\"person\"><div class=\"avatar\">MZ</div><div class=\"name\">Mei Zhang</div><div class=\"role\">Product Designer</div><div class=\"bio\">Joined 2022 from Procore. Owns the design work on medical billing and real estate engagements.</div></div>\n        <div class=\"person\"><div class=\"avatar\">TR</div><div class=\"name\">Tyler Robicheaux</div><div class=\"role\">Operations Lead</div><div class=\"bio\">Runs vendor management, the SOC 2 program, and our project cadence. Ex-Army logistics.</div></div>\n        <div class=\"person\"><div class=\"avatar\">PI</div><div class=\"name\">Priya Iyer</div><div class=\"role\">Office &amp; People Ops</div><div class=\"bio\">Joined 2020. Runs hiring, benefits, the office in Baton Rouge, and the company calendar.</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n  <footer>\n    © 2026 LouisianaTech, LLC · <a href=\"/privacy\">Privacy</a> · <a href=\"/terms\">Terms</a> · build a4f1c8b · deployed 2026-05-27\n  </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
}
